	<div class="wpb_raw_code wpb_content_element wpb_raw_html vc_custom_1654841550121" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
				<div class="wtwp-testimonials-slider-wrp wptww-clearfix " data-conf="{&quot;slides_column&quot;:1,&quot;slides_scroll&quot;:1,&quot;dots&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;arrows&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;autoplay&quot;:&quot;true&quot;,&quot;autoplay_interval&quot;:3000,&quot;rtl&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;speed&quot;:300,&quot;adaptive_height&quot;:&quot;false&quot;}">
		<div id="wptww-testimonials-slidelist-1" class="wptww-testimonials-slidelist design-1">
		<div class="wptww-quote">
	<div class="wptww-testimonial-left">
					<div class="wptww-avtar-image"></div>
			</div>
	<div class="wptww-testimonial-content">
		<i class="fa fa-quote-left"></i>
		<h4>रमा लघाटे</h4>
		<div class="wptww-testimonials-text">
			<p>
				 <em> उत्तम दर्जा, ताजेपणा, चवींचे वैविध्य आणि पारंपरिक चव म्हणजे कात्रज डेअरीचे पदार्थ. तुम्हीही नक्कीच चव चाखून बघा. </em> 			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	</div><div class="wptww-quote">
	<div class="wptww-testimonial-left">
					<div class="wptww-avtar-image"></div>
			</div>
	<div class="wptww-testimonial-content">
		<i class="fa fa-quote-left"></i>
		<h4>रंजना बनसोडे</h4>
		<div class="wptww-testimonials-text">
			<p>
				 <em> घरात कोणताही गोड पदार्थ करायचे ठरले की दुध, दही सगळे काही मी कात्रज डेअरीचेच वापरते. आमच्या सासुबाईंपासून घरात कात्रज डेअरीचेच प्रॉडक्ट्स येतात आणि आता माझी नातवंडे देखील आवडीने कात्रजचेच पदार्थ मागवतात. </em> 			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	</div><div class="wptww-quote">
	<div class="wptww-testimonial-left">
					<div class="wptww-avtar-image"></div>
			</div>
	<div class="wptww-testimonial-content">
		<i class="fa fa-quote-left"></i>
		<h4>रेणुका येवलेकर</h4>
		<div class="wptww-testimonials-text">
			<p>
				 <em> आमच्या घरात सगळ्यांना कात्रज डेअरीचेच प्रॉडक्ट्स आवडतात. अगदी लहानांपासून मोठ्यांपर्यंत सगळ्यांच्या आवडीनिवडी जपणारे कात्रज डेअरी अत्यंत दर्जेदार आणि चविष्ट प्रतीचे सगळे प्रॉडक्ट्स बाजारात आणतात. </em> 			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	</div><div class="wptww-quote">
	<div class="wptww-testimonial-left">
					<div class="wptww-avtar-image"></div>
			</div>
	<div class="wptww-testimonial-content">
		<i class="fa fa-quote-left"></i>
		<h4>Sanket Gharge</h4>
		<div class="wptww-testimonials-text">
			<p>
				 <em> We are very much happy and satisfied with the quality of Katraj milk and also other dairy products like ice creams, paneer, flavored milk and lassi. We trust Karaj Dairy Products for their continued quality and standards. My children enjoy the taste of Katraj milk and they enjoy the desserts made out of it at home. Curd prepared from this milk is thick and rich in taste. </em> 			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	</div><div class="wptww-quote">
	<div class="wptww-testimonial-left">
					<div class="wptww-avtar-image"></div>
			</div>
	<div class="wptww-testimonial-content">
		<i class="fa fa-quote-left"></i>
		<h4>Varsha Dhumal</h4>
		<div class="wptww-testimonials-text">
			<p>
				 <em> We just wanted to let you know that it’s the best and tastiest milk I have ever had. We certainly enjoy all the products from Katraj dairy and they are our favorite. If we have functions and celebrations at home or want to gift something edible to friends or relatives, we prefer Katraj dairy. </em> 			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	</div><div class="wptww-quote">
	<div class="wptww-testimonial-left">
					<div class="wptww-avtar-image"></div>
			</div>
	<div class="wptww-testimonial-content">
		<i class="fa fa-quote-left"></i>
		<h4>Anil Mali</h4>
		<div class="wptww-testimonials-text">
			<p>
				 <em> We love Katraj milk and its varied products available in the market. Every day we use Katraj milk and our son loves all dairy products from Katraj. Talking about the fact; it tastes much better than any other brand that we tried earlier. Tea tastes excellent with Katraj milk and asking my son to have a glass of milk had never been so easier. He always utters Mom the milk tastes yummy and every ready to drink it. </em> 			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	</div>		</div>
	</div>

	
		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner "><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div class="wpb_single_image widget wpb_content_element vc_align_left">
		<h2 class="wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading widget-title title-lg space-10">sadfv</h2>
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
